    <h2 class="section-title">Who Am I?</h2>
    <div class="section-line"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text fade-up">
      <p>Hello! I'm <strong>Geetha Krishna Venkatesh Maroju</strong>, a Python Developer based in Hyderabad, India. I build backend applications, REST APIs, and cloud-native solutions on <strong>Microsoft Azure</strong>.</p>
      <p>I completed my B.Tech in Computer Science from JNTUK Kakinada and additionally completed international coursework in <strong>AI & Data Science</strong> at Blekinge Institute of Technology, Sweden. I've interned at 4 companies across Python, Data Analytics, and Machine Learning domains.</p>
      <p>When I'm not coding, you'll find me <strong>playing games, learning through YouTube & Google</strong>, and exploring the latest in AI and cloud technologies.</p>
      <div class="code-card fade-up" style="margin-bottom:1.75rem;">
